\item[S2] Wenjie Fang, \emph{Searching on the boundary of abundance for odd weird numbers}, arXiv:2207.12906 (2022), Section 1, abundance, semiperfectness and the odd-weird-number existence question. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.12906}.
